WHY THIS PATCH EXISTS
    Spell::SendCastResult has the final failure reason after CheckCast, while
    AllSpellScript::OnSpellCheckCast sees only an input to validation. Expose
    the failed result, spell id and explicit target to scripts so mod-overseer
    can record roster cast failures without a client. Refs mod-overseer#968.

WHAT WOULD LET THIS PATCH BE DELETED
    An upstream hook at SendCastResult with the same information. Replace this
    patch when an upstream PR is merged; no upstream PR exists yet.

APPLIES TO
    mod-playerbots/azerothcore-wotlk @ 7f12e89ee5f467a50e62eba1d525eac7dc953d03
    Spell::SendCastResult and the AllSpellScript dispatcher.

